          "value": "SHA-1/SHA-2 family available in the dependency tree: the sha.js package (pinned at create-hash deps 5713, create-hmac deps 5728, pbkdf2 deps 13545) implements SHA-1/224/256/384/512 in pure JS. Additionally the lockfile itself pins ~200 legacy dev packages with sha1- integrity hashes and the rest with sha512- (npm integrity verification). All dev-scope toolchain crypto; the application performs no hashing. Not Shor-vulnerable; SHA-1 pins are collision-legacy only."
